DESCRIPTION:AAPIC North Bay is thrilled to host our first-ever fundraising
  gala\, Lanterns & Vines - an unforgettable evening celebrating AAPI che
 fs\, vintners\, culture\, and community.\n\nJoin us for a vibrant night-ma
 rket inspired experience featuring your choice of 4 food and wine pairings
 \, live entertainment\, night market games\, dancing\, and **special gues
 t celebrity chef Martin Yan**. The evening will spotlight AAPIC’s growin
 g impact across the North Bay\, and invite our community to help sustain a
 nd expand this important work. \n\nIncluded in your ticket is not only fo
 od and wine pairings\, but Photo Booth fun\, a red envelope wall\, live an
 d silent auction\, dancing\, boba & more!
LOCATION:Friedman Event Center
URL:http://aapicnorthbay.org/lanternsandvines
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
