BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Emergence - Spring Through the Eyes of the Artists
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T160000
UID:260401ySIh_mQQLEeGFepYXDP0-w
DESCRIPTION:"Emergence" brings together the Artists of Fulton Crossing to 
 explore what Spring means to their creative lives. Spring is more than a s
 eason. It's a metaphor. It's renewal\, risk\, color\, thawing\, blooming\,
  awakening\, and sometimes even struggles. The public is invited to enjoy 
 this free Art exhibit and to take time to wander through the artists studi
 os and gallery spaces. Meet the artists at our opening reception March 21s
 t. Upcoming Art Workshops: March 21: Painting Easter Cookies. April 18: Ci
 gar Box Collage. May 16: Succulent Garden Centerpiece. Make treasures to b
 ring home. All ages welcome. Materials provided. E-mail Brenda at nanaspre
 ttypaper@outlook.com for preregistration and workshop info.
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/emergence-spring-through-the-eyes-of-
 the-artists/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Art\, Sip & Stroll 2026 Tasting Package
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T170000
UID:260401Qg4EYELMWUKqAToZXKqcQg
DESCRIPTION:Yountville Arts presents the 14th Annual Art\, Sip &amp\; Stro
 ll\, on \n\nSaturday\, May 16\, 2026\, from 11:00 AM to 5:00 PM. \n\nArt\,
  Sip &amp\; Stroll\, the Napa Valley's largest visual arts event\, is an o
 pen-air event offering visitors and valley residents the opportunity to en
 joy fine art\, fine wine and great food in the heart of Napa Valley. There
  is no charge to enjoy the event\, which is situated throughout the center
  of town and ample parking is available. Once parked\, guests are encourag
 ed to walk or use the free Yountville Bee Bus to travel throughout Town. \
 n\nStroll downtown Yountville's Washington Street where over 70 juried art
 ists\, wineries\, tasting rooms and live musical performances await attend
 ees. For guests who find that perfect painting\, sculpture\, ceramics\, ph
 otography\, jewelry or work of art in a variety of mediums\, concierge ser
 vices are available for shipping\, wrapping and will call to hold items un
 til the end of the event. Complete the day by purchasing lunch on site fro
 m local food vendors and relax in one of the town's park-like venues\, or 
 make reservations for lunch or dinner at one of Yountville's celebrated re
 staurants at yountville.com/dining.\n\nGuests can enjoy the art at no char
 ge\, or they can purchase an &ldquo\;Art\, Sip &amp\; Stroll&rdquo\; tasti
 ng package for $50/pp which includes a tasting glass with 5 wine tasting t
 okens to be used at over 20 unique wine tasting stops until 4 PM\, plus a 
 signed Art\, Sip &amp\; Stroll 2026 poster. All proceeds from Art\, Sip &a
 mp\; Stroll Tasting Package sales support the Arts.
LOCATION:Yountville Library
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/art-sip-stroll-2026-tastin
 g-package?aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
