BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Judgment of Paris-The Swirled Cup Documentary
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T180000
UID:260324KVTe0j-AvUOVNUnYFcHV-g
DESCRIPTION:*The Swirled Cup* explores the pivotal 1976 Judgment of Paris 
 tasting that reshaped the 8\,000-year-old wine industry in just one genera
 tion.\n\nThis groundbreaking documentary will take you on a vibrant journe
 y into the culture of wine\, exploring how the combination of soil\, clima
 te\, topography\, and human tradition-'terroir'-not only gives life to the
  vines\, but also defines the personality of each wine.\n\nJoin Master Som
 melier Andrea Immer Robinson for this 40-minute documentary\, panel discus
 sion with the wine makers\, and wine tasting of each of the wines discusse
 d in the documentary. Then\, head over to The Grove restaurant to enjoy a 
 specially curated French-inspired four-course prix fixe dinner experience 
 where you will have the opportunity to pair the wines from the documentary
  perfectly with each and every course.
LOCATION:CIA at Copia
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/judgment-of-paris-the-swirled-cup-documen
 tary-tickets-1985409277595?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mitch Thomas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T000000
UID:260319WZC2IXdaHUqdQMHeEwG1Zw
DESCRIPTION:Based in the San Francisco Bay Area\, Dave Sampson is a freela
 nce guitarist\, producer\, multi-instrumtentalist and music instructor. Dr
 awing from his experiences living and playing in the music scenes of Austi
 n\, Los Angeles\, Seattle\, and Memphis\, Sampson put roots down in the Ba
 y Area in 2004. Dave's vibrant and versatile style supports a wide range o
 f genres and artists. His work can be heard on a variety of records\, majo
 r films\, and national radio and television shows. Always favoring taste\,
  melody\, and finding the perfect complimentary part\, his approach to pla
 ying has been compared to Mike Campbell\, David Lindley\, Mark Knopfler\, 
 Daniel Lanois and Lindsey Buckingham.
LOCATION:The Block
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107917956?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
