BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Atomic Cocktail drops at the Speakeasy in Sonoma\, Saturday\, May 
 16\, 8:30-11:30\, $10 Cover
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T203000
UID:260514jd3fQLYVMECDluvldxRo8w
DESCRIPTION:Hop into the Way Back Machine as Atomic Cocktail brings their 
 show of Retro Americana to the Speakeasy.  Playing "Songs Of The Atomic Ag
 e"\, this band focuses on music from 1945 to the mid-sixties.  From Louis 
 Jordan to Dean Martin\, From Ray Charles to Elvis to Johnny Cash.  From Bo
 b Wills to the Searchers.  Danceable groovy music served up piping hot. So
 noma Speakeasy is Sonoma's secret gem of a music venue\, located in downto
 wn at the end of an alley and filled with the charms of a previous era. "S
 tep back in time to the Atomic Age! Atomic Cocktail hits the stage at The 
 Sonoma Speakeasy for a night of swing\, jump blues\, and vintage vibes." A
 tomic Cocktail is:  Mark Larson- guitar/vocals/trumpet\, John Arntz- uprig
 ht bass/vocals\, Bruce Gordon- keyboards\, Michael Gay- drums/vocals. \\#S
 onomaSpeakeasy \\#SonomaValley \\#SonomaCA \\#SonomaPlaza \\#NorthBayLiveM
 usic \\#SonomaCounty \\#VisitSonoma \\#AtomicCocktail \\#AtomicAgeMusic \\
