DESCRIPTION:Join experienced salsa instructor Tyler Crandall for a beginne
 r-friendly class that welcomes everyone from absolute newcomers to seasone
 d dancers ready to explore salsa. Tyler's approach focuses on building str
 ong fundamentals through clear instruction of essential dance steps\, clas
 sic patterns\, and the foundational techniques that make salsa both beauti
 ful and enjoyable to dance. In Tyler's supportive\, pressure-free environm
 ent\, you'll learn to dance with partners while developing confidence and 
 connection on the dance floor. Whether you're taking your first dance step
 s or adding salsa to your existing repertoire\, the emphasis is on creatin
 g a welcoming space where everyone can learn at their own pace and truly e
 njoy the process. No experience or partner necessary – just bring yourse
 lf in comfortable shoes and be ready to dance! Tyler's patient instruction
  and encouraging atmosphere make this the perfect place to discover the jo
 y and rhythm of salsa dancing.This class is drop-in friendly. There are Le
 vel 2 classes at 2pm right afterwards for those that have completed level 
 1. This class takes place on Saturday afternoons at 1:00pm at Studio Move 
 1808B Empire Industrial Ct Santa Rosa\, CA
