BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:May Chantey Sings at Mare Island
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T160000
UID:260514_FdFDFQeF0C-rn8zPQHFIQ
DESCRIPTION:Location: The Mare Island Coal Sheds at 860 Nimitz Ave\, Valle
 jo\, CA 94592. There is a large parking lot\, and you will see the back of
  the Coal Sheds with the tall ships peeking over the roof. We’ll have tw
 o Chantey Sings simultaneously: an a cappella sing in the hold of the C. A
 . Thayer\, and a parallel session in one of the Coal Sheds. The Coal Shed 
 event meets ADA requirements. Both events are free and open to the public\
 ; however\, the hold of the Thayer is limited to 49 people by the Fire Mar
 shall and is not ADA accessible. We will take breaks and rotate participan
 ts from the Coal Shed. Due to limited space on the C. A. Thayer\, RESERVAT
 IONS ARE REQUIRED by email to casey\\_fenton@nps.gov. The Coal Sheds are l
 arge rooms formerly used by the Navy to store coal. One of them is now occ
 upied by the Mare Island Brewing Company\, and food and beverages can be p
 urchased there. One of them has retail space and facilities. Most of them 
 are empty and open on the side facing the water\, and we use one of the th
 ose for the Chantey Sing. The organizers would love to have more instrumen
 tal participation at the Coal Shed sing. Amateurs are especially encourage
 d\, as well as seasoned chantey players--we'd like this event to be a welc
 oming and low-pressure place for people who are just learning or rediscove
 ring music and chantey folklore. New to the Chantey Sing? This is a sessio
 n of sea chanteys and other types of seafaring\, fishing\, and rowing song
 s. All are welcome to lead songs\, and admission is free. For more informa
 tion\, please email casey\\_fenton@nps.gov. The sings are part of the inte
 rpretive programming at San Francisco Maritime National Historical Park.
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1410225357538231/?acontext=%7B%22event
 _action_history%22%3A[%7B%22mechanism%22%3A%22lov_feed%22%2C%22surface%22%
 3A%22bookmark%22%7D]%2C%22ref_notif_type%22%3Anull%7D
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
