BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Paella with PEJU
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T210000
UID:260421NVIoqn_nl0KtphmsG6BHkQ
DESCRIPTION:Paella with PEJU is an unforgettable evening at PEJU Province 
 Winery in Rutherford\, where the ancient tradition of Spanish paella comes
  alive under the open sky of Napa Valley. Watch as PEJU's talented chefs p
 repare two authentic paellas in giant pans over an open flame\, filling th
 e estate air with the irresistible aromas of saffron\, seafood\, and spice
  — a nod to the farm laborers of Spain who first created this beloved di
 sh using only what was at hand.  Guests will savor the feast alongside a c
 urated selection of PEJU's food-friendly wines\, perfectly chosen to compl
 ement the rich\, layered flavors of the paella. As the evening unfolds\, e
 njoy the warmth of live music drifting across the vineyard while indulging
  in PEJU's signature dessert buffet — a sweet finale to a truly memorabl
 e Napa Valley experience.  Space is limited — reserve your table for thi
 s extraordinary evening in wine country.
URL:https://www.winecountry.com/event/paella-with-peju/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
