DESCRIPTION:Enjoy your yoga experience in the beautiful setting of our par
 k! Susan Topf's Yoga Hike balances a mix of easy hiking and gentle yoga po
 stures\, breath work and guided meditation\, no mat necessary. The route v
 aries on weather conditions and group interest\, typically covering 2-3 mi
 les of varied terrain. All levels and ages welcome. Tickets are $30 and in
 clude parking if registered in advance online. Please wear weather-appropr
 iate clothing to feel comfortable being in a natural setting and bring wat
 er \\(as needed\\). Meet outside the Visitor Center unless otherwise noted
  in the reminder email prior to the hike. Limited to 12 participants. Sono
 ma County Resident? Free with a November 2025 or newer Park Rx from a part
 icipating Sonoma County Medical Provider.
