 at Grace Benoist Ranch in Carneros. Led by Winemaker Jon Priest and the Et
 ude team\, this immersive experience offers a behind-the-scenes look at th
 e vineyard that defines Etude’s celebrated Pinot Noir\, with insights in
 to sustainable farming and winemaking craftsmanship.    Following the tour
 \, guests will enjoy a relaxed\, family-style alfresco lunch among the vin
 es\, featuring wood-fired pizza\, fresh salads\, and dessert paired with E
 tude wines.
