BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Caves\, Keyholes\, and Culinary Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260517T060000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260517T110000
UID:2605135o7AOcreAkaujSLIrCKK6Q
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we explore the intertidal zones and sea caves near 
 Elephant Cave\, passing through tide pools on the way from one beach to an
 other. This out-and-back adventure begins at the McClures Beach trailhead.
  The hike requires a high level of physical fitness\, moderate stamina\, g
 ood balance and agility. You will need to do some wading\, and navigate sl
 ippery rocks and boulders. These areas are only accessible on a handful of
  days where there is a negative low tide\, so we must depart promptly. Aft
 er our hike we will enjoy a farm-to-table meal made by the farmer and with
  ingredients from the Ranch at Sonoma Mountain.
LOCATION:McClures Beach Trailhead
URL:https://pointreyesadventureco.com/calendar
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
