DESCRIPTION:Exploring Oil Pastels\n\nThis often-overlooked medium is great
  because it offers vibrant\, painterly color with the convenience of a sti
 ck\, providing rich textures\, easy blending\, and versatility without the
  mess or drying time of paint\, making it perfect for spontaneous\, expres
 sive art at all skill levels.\n\nIn this beginner's class\, we'll practice
  making two art pieces: one still-life subject & one face. Jump in & explo
 re with me!
LOCATION:Full Circle Studio
URL:https://www.taradickinson.com/lets-create/art-classes
