BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Theater For Children presents Shrek JR
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260517T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260517T160000
UID:260424s0lLLUQPqUuYrhcRNs8_5w
DESCRIPTION:SHREK JR. is a laugh-filled\, family-friendly musical where ev
 eryone’s favorite ogre learns that real beauty comes from the inside. Wi
