DESCRIPTION:The Petaluma Community Band invites all music lovers\, familie
 s\, and the curious to experience the energy of a live performance. Whethe
 r you are a seasoned concertgoer or attending your first band performance\
 , discover the musical talent from Petaluma and beyond. The concert featur
 es band masterpieces\, a Broadway show medley\, and unique selections reve
 aling the rich wind band repertoire. Audiences can expect exciting new arr
 angements\, all performed with the passion and precision that have become 
 the group’s hallmark.Chat with members afterward during around free refr
