UID:260514Mo3j2T5WBkOVw4INYFP9sQ
DESCRIPTION:Ready to dance Salsa On2? North Bay SBK is bringing New York S
 tyle Salsa to Sonoma County! This class is designed for experienced On1 da
 ncers who want to add On2 \\(also called Mambo\\) to their dance repertoir
 e. If you're comfortable with On1 and ready to explore the smooth\, musica
 l style that defines dance floors in New York\, festivals worldwide\, and 
 international socials\, this class is for you. What You'll Learn: On2 timi
 ng and musicality \\(breaking on the 2\\) Modern Mambo shines and footwork
  Turn patterns and partner work Techniques used by dancers at socials\, co
 ngresses\, and competitions globally Why Learn On2? Salsa On2 opens up new
  musical interpretation\, smoother partnering\, and connects you to the wo
 rldwide Mambo community. Whether you're traveling to dance festivals or wa
 nt to elevate your social dancing locally\, On2 gives you versatility and 
 style. Who Should Join: Experienced On1 dancers looking to expand their sk
 ills and social dance On2 with confidence. Studio Move\, Santa Rosa Tuesda
 ys at 7pm-8pm ️ Starting April 7\, 2026  Monthly members can apply their
  membership to this class. Drop-in friendly! Drop in: $25 4 class credits:
  $80 This class will take place on Tuesday nights from 7pm to 8pm at Studi
 o Move 1808B Empire Industrial Ct Santa Rosa\, CA
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1300690221934674/?acontext=%7B%22event
 _action_history%22%3A[%7B%22mechanism%22%3A%22lov_feed%22%2C%22surface%22%
 3A%22bookmark%22%7D]%2C%22ref_notif_type%22%3Anull%7D
