DESCRIPTION:Learn how to capture peak-season strawberries in this hands-on
  preservation workshop with Leslie Goodrich of Lala’s Jam \\+ Urban Far
 mstand. You’ll explore simple\, practical methods for making flavorful p
 reserves to enjoy beyond the harvest.\n\nIn this workshop you’ll:\n\n•
  Learn the basics of home preservation and safe canning\n\n• Make lower 
 sugar strawberry jam\n\n• Create strawberry infused vinegar and a syrup 
 for shrubs\n\n• Understand how to balance flavor\, acidity\, and texture
 \n\nYou’ll leave with three strawberry preserves to take home. All mat
 erials provided. No experience required.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
URL:https://gathersebastopol.com/products/preserve-the-season-strawberries
