DESCRIPTION:The Vallejo Evaluation Team overseeing the implementation of t
 he reforms under the Agreement between the City of Vallejo and the Califor
 nia Department of Justice would like to hear from the Vallejo Community as
  we move into Year Three of the Evaluation Program.\n\nWe invite the Valle
 jo community to participate in a listening session to share their perspect
 ives regarding the Vallejo Police Department \\(VPD\\) and noted improveme
 nts\, as well as further actions the community believes are necessary.\n\n
 We would also like to hear about your experiences with VPD and the outcome
 s you would like to see under the reform work.\n\nThis session will be in 
 person only\, and a summary of notes will be posted on our website.
LOCATION:Vallejo City Hall\, Council Chambers
URL:https://www.vallejomonitor.com/events-2
