BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Abbotts Lagoon Plants
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260520T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260520T140000
UID:260513q8AO0FjDzkiq8aynCSUmsQ
DESCRIPTION:Directions: Meet at Abbotts Lagoon parking lot. From Hwy 101 i
 n Larkspur\, take the exit for Sir Francis Drake Blvd west 20.4 miles to O
 lema. Turn right onto Hwy 1 and go 2 miles. Turn left onto Sir Francis Dra
 ke Blvd and go 6.4 miles. Turn right at Pierce Point Rd and go 3.4 miles\,
  the trailhead is on the left.\n\nSponsor: Parks\n\nAccommodation Informat
 ion: If you are a person with a disability and require an accommodation to
  participate in a County program\, service\, or activity\, r equests may b
 e made by calling 415-473-4381 \\(Voice\\)\, Dial 711 for CA Relay\, or by
  submitting a\n\nDisability Accommodation Request\n\nat least five busines
 s days in advance of the event. We will do our best to fulfill requests re
 ceived with less than five business days' notice. Copies of documents are 
 available in alternative formats upon request.\n\nAs spring is winding dow
 n in inland areas\, the maritime influence prolongs the bloom season along
  the coast of Point Reyes. We'll take our time exploring this area for an 
 interesting assort ment of\, sometimes small and cryptic\, dune and coasta
 l plant species. Total miles: 3. There's little elevation change but we'll
  be w alking in deep\, dry sand at times. This walk is offered in partners
 hip with Point Reyes National Seashore. Remember to bring lunch\, and bino
 culars if you have them. No pets are allowed\, except for service/companio
 n animals. Adverse weather or poor air quality may cancel. Registration is
  required.\n\nQuestions: Contact\n\nShannon Burke
LOCATION:Point Reyes National Seashore
URL:https://www.marincounty.gov/county-marin-calendar
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
