DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T160000
UID:260515-JS5T8AbpECail6oVHoiFQ
DESCRIPTION:You already know everything you need to walk in the door. No p
 reparation. No expertise. No right answers.\n\nDying to Talk About It is a
  facilitated conversation where neighbors come together to speak honestly 
 about death and dying – what we fear\, what we hope for\, what we’ve w
 itnessed\, and what we carry.\n\nWhat you bring to this room matters. Your
  stories\, your questions\, your silence — all of it has a place here. A
  trained facilitator holds the space so the conversation can go somewhere 
 real.
LOCATION:Healdsburg Senior Center
URL:http://whenthetimecomes.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SIR Branch 17 - Emergence of Artificial Intelligence in Medicine
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T133000
UID:260514ZxihaOU_RU2aXyvZEucynQ
DESCRIPTION:Enrich Your Life – SIR Branch 17 – Emergence of Artificial
  Intelligence in Medicine.\n\nSIR Branch 17 will hold its next meeting on 
 Thursday\, May 21\, 2026.  Our speaker will be Dr. Brian Schmidt who will
  talk about the Emergence of Artificial Intelligence in Medicine Today and
  its Applications in the Future.  Dr. Schmidt helped start the laparoscop
 ic program as well as the trauma service at Santa Rosa Memorial Hospital. 
  He runs the trauma service as the medical director at Memorial Hospital.
 \n\nRESERVATIONS REQUIRED.  Members pay for lunch but its Free for invite
 d first-time guests.  Contact us for more details on how to receive an in
 vitation.\n\nSIR\, Inc. is a California non-profit organization that provi
 des social activities for men and their partners whose mission is: “To e
 nhance the lives of our members through fun activities\, luncheons and eve
 nts while making Friends for Life”.\n\nSIR Branch 17 meets in Santa Rosa
  for socializing\, lunch\, and an interesting speaker every 3rd Thursday o
 f the month.  In addition to our luncheon\, we organize other activities\
 , including Golf\, Bocce\, Poker\, Bridge\, Dining Out \\(with & without p
 artners\\)\; Global Affairs\; Pickleball\; Coffee Club\; Beer\, Wine & Spi
 rits\; Book Club\; Hiking/Walking\; and more!\n\nLive longer and happier w
 ith good friends while enjoying fun activities.  We don’t raise money\,
  have a political agenda\, a religious orientation\, or sell anything.  F
 or more information\, visit us at www.SIR17.org or contact us by phone at 
 \\(707\\) 596-8027 or email at SIRBr17@gmail.com
LOCATION:Victory House
URL:https://www.sir17.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
