BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wine Tails Trail at Cuvaison Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T170000
UID:2605085NddAZz0q0O9UiEW2s-TwA
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a new way to experience Cuvaison with your canine compan
 ion on the Wine Tails Trail. This self-guided vineyard walk winds just und
 er a mile through our Los Carneros estate\, with QR code stops highlightin
 g the history of our vines and winemaking. Guests begin their adventure by
  checking in with our Concierge for a map and orientation before setting o
 ff on the trail.\n\nAfter the walk\, return to the estate and enjoy a seat
 ed tasting of our current release wines\, while your pup relaxes by your s
 ide and enjoys a selection of “Barkuterie.” The Wine Tails Trail is a 
 chance to stretch your legs\, explore the vineyard\, and savor Cuvaison in
  the company of your best friend.\n\nWhen booking this experience\, please
  plan for the dog walk to begin at the time you select. The walk itself av
 erages about 45 minutes\, though you’ll also check in with our Concierge
  before and after\, as well as complete a quick waiver at the start. Your 
 wine tasting will be scheduled 60 minutes after your selected walk time\, 
 allowing a smooth transition from the trail back to your seated experience
 .\n\nGroup Size: Up to 4 guests\, including non-tasters\n\nDuration: Pleas
 e allow 120 minutes for this experience
LOCATION:Cuvaison Experience Salon\, Outdoors Only
URL:https://tewines.com/pages/cuvaison-tastings 
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Taste of Italy at Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T170000
UID:260430MB3RemsLDUG3z_Ibq73w7A
DESCRIPTION:For wine drinkers eager to experience world-class wines made i
 n California from Italian varieties\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
  is a must during any trip to Sonoma County. Located just off the plaza in
  the charming town of Healdsburg near famed restaurants\, boutiques and ga
 lleries\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room is a destination that invit
 es discovery. Founded by the acclaimed team that guides renowned Pinot Noi
 r and Chardonnay producer Rhys Vineyards\, Centennial Mountain was establi
 shed to explore Italian grape varieties grown on its acclaimed Centennial 
 Mountain Vineyard in the rugged mountains of Northern Sonoma County.\n\nTh
 e Centennial Mountain Vineyard Tasting features the winery’s coveted Neb
 biolo\, and the pioneering Carricante and Nerello Mascalese wines\, among 
 others. To showcase how beautifully the wines pair with food\, the winery 
 also offers a delicious Wine and Sushi Pairing from nearby Asahi Sushi\, o
 ne of Healdsburg’s most popular dining destinations.\n\nGuests can also 
 enhance their tasting experience with a curated salumi board from Journeym
 an Meat Company. This generous accompaniment features six house-made salum
 i\, crostini\, cornichons\, olives\, and a selection of local cheese that 
 serves 2 to 5 guests.
LOCATION:Centennial Mountain Tasting Room 
URL:https://cmvineyard.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Belly Dancing with Raja
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T183000
UID:260420OLE90EhHQUahq7HPdRZGxw
DESCRIPTION:Unlock your inner strength and find your flow. Belly dancing 
 with Raja is an innovative fusion class that blends the rhythmic artistry 
 of belly dance with the high-energy benefits of aerobics. Designed to b
 e both a cardiovascular challenge and a deep toning session\, this class f
 ocuses on the “powerhouse” of the body—your core.\n\nBy layering flu
 id\, isolative movements over an athletic aerobic base\, you will challeng
 e your muscles in ways traditional gym workouts can’t reach.\n\nWhat to 
 Expect\n\n• Core-Centric Power: Use undulations and shimmies to engage 
 deep abdominal muscles for a tighter\, stronger midsection.\n\n• Functio
 nal Stability: Improve your balance and posture through controlled\, hip-
 driven movements and low-impact aerobic footwork.\n\n• Total Body Toning
 : Build lean muscle in your legs\, glutes\, and arms while maintaining a 
 constant\, heart-pumping pace.\n\n• Mind-Body Connection: Enhance your 
 coordination and body awareness through rhythmic\, expressive choreography
 .\n\n“Whether you’re looking to define your waistline or simply want a
  workout that feels like a celebration\, this class offers the perfect bal
 ance of sweat and grace.”\n\nDifficulty Level: All levels welcome! No p
 rior dance experience is required—just bring your energy and a willingne
 ss to move.\n\nDATE AND TIME: Thursdays at 5:30 PM
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/belly-dancing-with-raja
 /18622402/2026-05-21T17
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
