DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the International Conference on Societal Transforma
 tion through Engineering\, Education\, Social Science\, and Humanities \\(
 ICSTESH 2026\\)\, taking place on May 21 & 22\, 2026\, in the dynamic and 
 rapidly developing city of Astana\, Kazakhstan. Organized by IFERP Academy
 \, this conference marks a transformative global platform where innovative
  minds\, researchers\, educators\, policymakers\, and industry leaders con
 verge to inspire real-world impact.\n\nWith the theme “Bridging Innovati
 on and Inclusion: Empowering Global Societal Transformation for a Sustaina
 ble Future\,” ICSTESH 2026 aims to spark groundbreaking ideas\, foster c
 ross-disciplinary collaboration\, and empower communities through knowledg
 e-driven solutions. We warmly invite you to be part of this enriching expe
 rience as we collectively shape a future anchored in sustainability\, incl
 usivity\, and global progress.
