 J Kitchen\n\nFriday\, July 10th\n\nTaylor Mountain | Taco Truck\n\nFriday\
 , July 24th\n\nSon Chevere\n\nFriday\, August 7th\n\nTommy Thomsen\n\nFrid
 ay\, August 21st\n\nSwing Fling | KJ Kitchen\n\nFriday\, September 11th\n\
 nThird Rail Band | Chads Soup Shack\n\nFriday\, September 25th\n\nThe Dori
 an Mode | Taco Truck
