UID:260425ZtJRYH7-Ak6SqWi5TXkWjA
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to save a life!\n\nFocusing on recognizing and treat
 ing life-threatening situations in the critical minutes before 911 arrives
 \, we will cover how to handle adult and infant cardiac arrest\, choking\,
  heart attack\, severe bleeding and more! We'll be using modern manikins a
 nd equipment in a small-group setting\, answering questions along the way.
 \n\nYour American Red Cross certificate will be valid for 2 years.\n\nThis
  is a blended course: Watch the videos and presentations online at your ow
 n convenience before joining your patient and friendly instructor to pract
 ice your new skills!\n\n\\(This community class event is held at a branch 
 of Sonoma County Library. We thank them for their hospitality. They have r
 equested that we mention that this program is neither sponsored by nor aff
 iliated with the Sonoma County Library. Done!\\)\n\nPlease get in touch wi
 th any questions!
