BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Boogie for Good
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T200000
UID:260504MdkjWWuqt0GnxKphZoVEIg
DESCRIPTION:Audacity Rising is proud to present our next big event of the 
 season. This rousing show will feature Dirty Cello\, an Internationally ac
 claimed Americana band bringing their version of rockin' covers of the 60'
 s and 70's with some of their own original material. They bring a high ene
 rgy concert not to be missed! The opening band for our headliner will be n
 one other than Tom Rigney and Flambeau\, one of the nation's finest and mo
 st accomplished Zydeco and Cajon Bayou bands known everywhere for their to
 p-of-the-line musical styles and exceptional musicianship\, not to mention
  some of the finest Cajon Fiddle and beautiful violin playing known to gra
 ce the stage. As always\, the proceeds will go to benefit the legal defens
 es of our marginalized immigrant communities who need the services provide
 d to them by our own North Bay's dedicated and gifted legal partners VIDAS
  (Vital Immigrant Defense and Advocacy Services).
LOCATION:Friedman Event Center
URL:https://audacityrisinginc.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Taste of Italy at Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T170000
UID:260430Jai7FWj7N0CiWNcmqzbgQw
DESCRIPTION:For wine drinkers eager to experience world-class wines made i
 n California from Italian varieties\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
  is a must during any trip to Sonoma County. Located just off the plaza in
  the charming town of Healdsburg near famed restaurants\, boutiques and ga
 lleries\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room is a destination that invit
 es discovery. Founded by the acclaimed team that guides renowned Pinot Noi
 r and Chardonnay producer Rhys Vineyards\, Centennial Mountain was establi
 shed to explore Italian grape varieties grown on its acclaimed Centennial 
 Mountain Vineyard in the rugged mountains of Northern Sonoma County.\n\nTh
 e Centennial Mountain Vineyard Tasting features the winery’s coveted Neb
 biolo\, and the pioneering Carricante and Nerello Mascalese wines\, among 
 others. To showcase how beautifully the wines pair with food\, the winery 
 also offers a delicious Wine and Sushi Pairing from nearby Asahi Sushi\, o
 ne of Healdsburg’s most popular dining destinations.\n\nGuests can also 
 enhance their tasting experience with a curated salumi board from Journeym
 an Meat Company. This generous accompaniment features six house-made salum
 i\, crostini\, cornichons\, olives\, and a selection of local cheese that 
 serves 2 to 5 guests.
LOCATION:Centennial Mountain Tasting Room 
URL:https://cmvineyard.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jazz in the Plaza
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T153000
UID:260419wkzftTJiiE-usiCGxKFAGg
DESCRIPTION:Every Sunday: Free\, live jazz every week performed by some of
  the best musicians in the SF Bay Area and beyond\, right in the heart of 
 downtown Petaluma! Every Sunday from 1 to 3:30\, local jazz bassist and mu
 sic book publisher Chuck Sher presents a rotating ensemble of professional
 \, veteran jazz musicians in Putnam Plaza Park\, right next to the Speakea
 sy. In partnership with Music in Place\, Jamey Aebersold Jazz Books\, JamB
 ar\, and MadCap Labs\, this event started in 2020 and has since become a s
 taple for locals and visitors alike. Stop by and enjoy some of the best ja
 zz the Bay Area has to offer!
LOCATION:Putnam Plaza Park
URL:https://www.facebook.com/jazzintheplazapetaluma
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:World Dance
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T110000
UID:260324ySv-UsziiUe3rtOt65f2vA
DESCRIPTION:Travel the World—No Passport Required!\n\nEvery Sunday at 10
 :00 AM\, grab your global one-way ticket to fitness. We’re traveling acr
 oss continents through rhythm and movement\, blending high-energy world da
 nces with a full-body workout. Whether you’re a seasoned pro or have two
  left feet\, come sweat\, smile\, and discover your new favorite beat.\n\n
 Who: All adult ages and skill levels.\n\nWhen: Sundays @ 10:00 AM.\n\nTh
 e Vibe: Pure fun\, global rhythms\, and a community that moves together.\
 n\nAbout Zeena\n\nZeena Quinn’s World Dance classes are based on learnin
 g coordination\, motivating the brain\, dance techniques\, and therefore\,
  mind-body transformation. By creating a supportive system\, participants 
 discover themselves in their own way via dance.\n\nParticipants will work 
 upper and lower body\, cardio and mostly rhythms & coordination. One will 
 understand and learn to identify the different rhythms while having fun! Z
 eena has a lifetime of experience in dance\, professional performance\, ch
 oreography\, teaching\, as well as\, in fitness and resistance training.\n
 \nZeena has toured the Bay Area presenting a variety of American swing\, C
 harlston\, hip hop\, disco\, line dances\, and international dance styles 
 such as Bollywood\, Afro-Brazilian/Samba\, Flamenco\, and European and Eas
 tern Folk. These authentic dance techniques demonstrate how our body is an
  instrument. Because of her extensive range of dance training\, she brings
  the authenticity of technique into her vibrant teaching style.\n\nCome ta
 ke a trip around theworld! Comfortable clothes and worn shoes that tie. No
  Hoka or hiking shoes please.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/world-dance/18336667/20
 26-05-24T10
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Collector’s Lunch Pairing at Lynmar Estate
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T143000
UID:260312l6tcSKTkn0mf0ckaeNzkRg
DESCRIPTION:Join Lynmar Estate for the ultimate luxury wine and food exper
 ience in the magical setting of Quail Hill Vineyard. Enjoy an elevated\, m
 ulti-course lunch seasonally paired with ultra-premium Pinot Noir and Char
 donnay. During your meal\, Estate Chef David Frakes will make a special ta
 bleside visit to complete your experience.\n\nReservations are required. M
 aximum group size is six guests. View a sample menu here:\n\nhttps://lynma
 restate.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Collectors-Lunch-Oct-2025.pdf
LOCATION:Lynmar Estate 
URL:https://lynmarestate.com/reservation/type/collectors-lunch-pairing/ 
