  Older Adult Health and Wellness Fair held in Pioneer Park in Calistoga. T
 he fair is scheduled for Wednesday\, May 27th from 10 am to 12 pm. The eve
 nt is focused on bringing information about older adult services in the co
 unty UpValley. \n\nWe will have Napa County’s Be Well Mobile Services V
 ehicle available for community members to access services such as Medi-Cal
