 both eye-catching and delicious. Event Details: Includes: Pasta dinner by 
 Chef River with curated wine pairings Timing: 4 hour class \\*Please note 
 this will require long periods of standing on hard floors. Theme: Duo past
 a making with flavored or colored doughs and fillings Availability: Extrem
 ely limited - only 10 seats available Club Members: Discount applies at ch
 eckout Dress Code: Casual\, closed-toe shoes Dietary Restrictions: We glad
 ly accommodate food allergies with advance notice so our guests can dine c
