 ea to bottling—while working with these traditional fermented beverages.
 \n\nIn this workshop you’ll:\n\n• Learn how to brew kombucha and jun a
 t home\n\n• Understand the role of the SCOBY and fermentation process\n\
 n• Taste finished ferments and learn how to gauge readiness\n\n• Explo
 re flavoring methods using fruit\, herbs\, and botanicals\n\n• Bottle yo
 ur own flavored kombucha or jun\n\nYou’ll leave with a SCOBY\, starter 
 liquid\, and your own bottled ferment to continue brewing at home. No exp
