BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:INTO THE LIGHT: Light-filled aintings by Katy Boggs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T170000
UID:260501f6Ojgt6yf02z70cJrIJMJA
DESCRIPTION:Katy's paintings are an exploration of light—how it shapes f
 orm\, reveals color\, and defines what we see.\n\n"I am drawn to moments w
 here light is felt as much as seen: filtering through dense leaves\, tower
 ing in the crowns of trees\, glinting off cresting waves\, or softening in
 to the quiet glow of a sunset. Light is everywhere\; without it\, there is
  no seeing. Beyond its physical presence\, it also carries a deeper resona
 nce as a symbol of hope. In a time of uncertainty\, this work seeks to bri
 ng light into the image\, both visually and metaphorically."\n\nReception:
  April 25\, 4 to 6 pm.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Gallery
URL:http://sebastopolgallery.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Compassion and Equanimity 7-Night Retreat
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T143000
UID:260430S9Vl7qBiP0qnw3lpQ1lFEg
DESCRIPTION:May 30 - Jun 6\, 2026 (7 nights)\n\nwith **Dawn Scott\, Susie
  Harrington\, Kodo Conlin**\n\nThrough the practices of compassion and eq
 uanimity\, our hearts discover a capacity for steadiness and love\, allowi
 ng us to remain open to the challenges of our times. Through guided medita
 tions\, Dharma talks\, group practice meetings\, contemplative verbal inqu
 iry\, and periods of sitting and walking meditation\, we’ll call on the 
 liberative power of compassion and equanimity to release a wise and heart-
 full response to the pain of our world. Although there will be periods of 
 discussion\, the majority of the retreat will be held in noble silence. Th
 is retreat is open to all levels of experience and to anyone interested in
  cultivating the relational and meditative ballasts of compassion and equa
 nimity.\n\nThis retreat is silent except for teacher-led Q&A\, small group
 s\, or other practice meetings.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://www.spiritrock.org/programs/retreats/326r26-compassion-and-equ
 animity-heart-full-wisdom-for-our-times
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
