BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jovino Santos Neto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T000000
UID:2602249wHPCifaFUGzK0zk_rHDvg
DESCRIPTION:Brazilian pianist and composer Jovino Santos Neto teams up wit
 h Scott Thompson and drummer David Flores to present his Brazilian music i
 n a piano trio format. The compositions by Jovino\, Hermeto Pascoal\, and 
 Marcos Valle will serve as points of departure for inspired musical conver
 sations among the three extraordinary players. The music will range from t
 he lyrical to the deep grooves this trio can generate.  Jovino’s persona
 l style is a creative blend of energetic harmonies\, telepathic improvisat
 ion\, lyrical melodies and great ensemble playing\, always inspired and in
 formed by the colorful richness of Brazilian music. His compositions inclu
 de samba\, choro\, baião\, xote\, forró\, marcha and many more styles\, 
 rooted in centuries-old musical tradition while pointing to new and advent
 urous harmonic languages.
