BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fuzz Collective
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T000000
UID:260331YcyviwU8EEausmMLMARE3g
DESCRIPTION:Fuzz Collective is a funk-infused rock outfit based in San Fra
 ncisco\, CA that tastefully mixes tight grooves\, soulful melodies\, and a
 cid jazz experimentations\, all with a retro flair. The group started in t
 he early 2000s and was simply called “Fuzz”. After Fuzz took a hiatus 
 for several years\, the band was reformed as Fuzz Collective\, which spark
 ed a revival in the band’s activity in the Bay Area scene with their sig
 nature sound and local live performances. Over the years\, the band has tr
 uly embraced its vision as a collective - working with various talented mu
 sicians in San Francisco both onstage and behind the scenes.\n\nFuzz Colle
 ctive recorded its debut full-length album in November 2023 at Color Red S
 tudios in Denver\, Colorado\, alongside Producer and President of Color Re
 d\,  Eddie Roberts \\(The New Mastersounds\, Lucky Strokes\\). This album 
 constructed a collection of new songs combining the Fuzz Collective's retr
 o-rock sound with legendary influences such as Steely Dan\, Jimi Hendrix\,
  The Brand New Heavies\, Curtis Mayfield\, and of course\, The New Masters
 ounds. The 11-song album will be released on 180g vinyl and available for 
 streaming worldwide via Color Red in 2024.\n\nThe band recently recorded i
 ts second album at 2200 Studios \\(formerly the Record Plant\\) in Sausali
 to. The 12 song album will be produced and mixed by Eddie Roberts.
LOCATION:Furthermore Wines
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107563797?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
