BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sunrise Urchin (Uni) Foraging (Sonoma Coast)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T050000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T083000
UID:260514WzcYKVRTBUWE0-KWq0h8mg
DESCRIPTION:Save Kelp\, Eat Urchin!\n\nJoin us at sunrise for a sea urchin
  foraging class\, where we will help remove some of the overgrown sea urch
 in population - so we can eat it! We will teach you how to open and enjoy 
 this incredible delicacy. You may have heard it called “uni” in a sush
 i restaurant\, but it’s SO much tastier when it’s fresh. Take home up 
 to 35 urchin - if you can carry that much! Learn how humans can be a helpi
 ng hand to restore balance to ecosystems impacted by climate change.\n\nCl
 ass Dates \\(single\, not a series\\)\n\n- May 17\n\n- May 31\n\n- June 14
 \n\nFork In The Path www.forkinthepath.org
LOCATION:Sonoma Coast
URL:https://www.forkinthepath.org/schedule/sea-urchin-uni-class-may-2026
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
