UID:260420BaSvAkV9S0KxgD6BhtqSoQ
DESCRIPTION:Visit the Federated Indians of Graton Rancheria \\(FIGR\\) Lea
 rning Center and trails of Osborn Preserve at an Open House! The Learning 
 Center - only 15 minutes from campus - is an incredible academic resource 
 for all disciplines: wifi and digital classrooms\, 450-acres on Sonoma Mou
 ntain\, and easy to schedule through the Center for Environmental Inquiry 
 \\(CEI\\) website. CEI Director and staff will be on-hand to schedule visi
 ts and discuss ideas for incorporating this new resource into courses\, pr
 ograms and initiatives. Join us for refreshments and an optional 45 minut
 e hike with a student who has completed our Naturalist Training Program.\n
 \nFor more about the new FIGR learning center: Federated Indians of Grato
 n Rancheria Learning Center Opens at Fairfield Osborn Preserve | Center fo
 r Environmental Inquiry at Sonoma State University\n\nPresenters\n\nKerry 
 Wininger\, Director\, SSU's Center for Environmental Inquiry\n\nLogistics\
 n\nNo previous experience or knowledge is required. This event is recommen
 ded for ages 18 and up.
