DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Pride Month at the opening reception for Pride and C
 ommunity during Sonoma Art Walk\, presented in partnership with Sonoma Val
 ley Pride. The exhibition features eight Sonoma County artists exploring i
 dentity\, joy\, resilience\, and belonging through ceramics\, painting\, p
 rintmaking\, performance art\, and augmented reality. Guests can meet the 
 artists while enjoying wines from Pangloss Cellars and bites from Aunt Mom
 o's Catering. The exhibit remains on view daily through June 30 with free 
 admission. Visitors can also explore Carry It With You\, a solo ceramics e
 xhibition by resident artist Ariana Stein at Gallery 212.
