UID:260224yqKtjNAmDU6ZuORh6Ck2kQ
DESCRIPTION:DJ\, Music Producer and Multi-instrumentalist FunkPharm has be
 en igniting dance floors for 20 years\, bringing Ecstatic Beats and funk-d
 riven Earthtronic rhythms. His debut album “ReMuse” is a collaboration
  with folk icons MaMuse\, re-vibing their heartfelt anthems into infectiou
 s dance tracks.  Check out FunkPharm's music on Spotify or your favorite
  music platform.\n\nHis DJ sets offer a wellspring of journey and groove\,
  drawing from Bass\, Afro-pop\, Latin Selvatica\, Trap\, Glitch-hop and Fo
 lktronic. He adds live drumming to his DJ sets\, infusing the dance floor 
 with global rhythms to draw out the primal and inspire us to continue the 
 revolution. Focusing on uplifting\, somatic transformation\, FunkPharm off
 ers ‘Music as Medicine & Dance as Prayer.”
LOCATION:Sebastopol Community Cultural Center
