BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Saturday Live Music at Spicy Vines feat. Open Hearts Band
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T180000
UID:260206jIl5y69bl0-b4P_WroVxfw
DESCRIPTION:Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come t
 ogether.\n\nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a tast
 ing room experience like no other — where top local musicians from acros
 s the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll an
 d Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new soun
 ds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\nOpen Hearts Band Open Hearts Ban
 d delivers home-grown folk rock with heartfelt lyrics\, rich harmonies\, a
 nd a soulful groove that sticks with you. Blending original songwriting wi
 th raw acoustic energy\, their sound is equal parts nostalgic and refreshi
 ngly real. \n\nDetails\n\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event
  tends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are d
 og and family friendly!
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/event/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
