 apa in Napa\, CA\n\n40\\+ local makers\n\nHandmade jewelry\, pottery\, fra
 grances\, candles\, bath and body\, apparel\, leather goods\, and more!\n\
 nKid- and pet-friendly\n\nEnjoy live music by local musicians\n\nStop into
  the Makers Market™ brick-and-mortar store \\(in Suite 301\, adjacent to
  the fair\\) and shop even more unique\, American-made products.\n\nShare 
 with your shopping buddies and mark your calendars! Can't wait to see you 
 there!\n\nAre you a maker looking to sell your products at the Local Artis
 t Street Fair? Register here: https://makersmarket.us/maker-registration/\
 n\nMakers Market is locally founded and independently owned\, with brick-a
 nd-mortar stores in Alpharetta\, Napa\, Santana Row\, Lafayette\, and Mill
  Valley. We aim to bring you products that honor the ideals of American cr
 aftsmanship and are modern\, handmade\, and sustainably produced. Join us 
 in our mission of Rebuilding the Legacy of American Made\, while supportin
 g our local artists\, local economies\, and the community. Come visit one 
