  Sonoma Plaza Grinstead Amphitheater during Sonoma Sundays On the Plaza\, 
 a free concert series running June 7 through October 4\, 2026.\n\nThis wee
 k's lineup features Cabanijazz Project! Javier Cabanillas is a Grammy-winn
 ing Mexican conga player\, composer\, and bandleader based in the San Fran
 cisco Bay Area. Cabanillas now leads Cabanijazz Project\, an electrifying 
 8-piece Latin ensemble performing original\, “hella” danceable music.\
 n\nSonoma Sundays are free and open to all\, thanks to the generous suppor
 t of the Sonoma Community Center\, The Dawn Redwoods Trust\, and the McNee
 ly Family Foundation.\n\nPack your picnic\, bring your dancing shoes\, and
  meet us on the Plaza!
