BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Flora & Fauna - 6 Week Watercolor Course
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T160000
UID:260225jcEFRqaqGkGVEtf_houI7w
DESCRIPTION:In this 6 week course\, participants will learn a unique appro
 ach to watercolor\, intended to alleviate the frustration that many experi
 ence when learning this beautiful yet challenging medium. The class will f
 ocus on strengthening one’s observational skills\, giving the artist a f
 oundation off of which to build their paintings in a step by step layering
  process\, that trains the artist to see value and color\n\nOur subjects w
 ill be flora and fauna - a sampling of plants and animals - fruits\, flora
 ls\, foliage\, and four legged friends. These subjects are great for begin
 ners and experienced watercolor painters alike\; their organic shapes make
  them forgiving drawing subjects\, but their beauty can be a muse for life
 . \n\nThis class will work from life and from photos\, practicing basic d
 rawing skills in addition to watercolor technique. With six class sessions
 \, participants will have the opportunity to develop their skills and buil
 d muscle memory with a medium that often feels like it has a mind of its o
 wn.\n\nAll materials provided.\n\nLocation: 755 Petaluma Ave\, Sebastopol\
 , CA\n\nDates: 6 Sundays - May 17\, 24\, 31\, June 7\, 14\, 21\n\nTime: 1 
 - 4 pm\n\nRegistration Fee: $300\n\nAges: Adults\n\nSkill Level: All Level
 s
LOCATION:Art & Soul Sebastopol
URL:https://www.hannahdrawstrees.com/flora-and-fauna-register-may
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lindsay Everly & The Evergreens
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T000000
UID:260224oZjG2s1sLkaJHEHmdBguMA
DESCRIPTION:Lindsay Everly is a Northern California–based Americana sing
 er/songwriter whose music blends folk\, bluegrass\, and West African influ
 ences into heartfelt\, cinematic storytelling. Raised in the Wisconsin cou
 ntryside\, her first piano lessons were on a dairy farm nearby her parents
  house. She crafts songs about travel\, lost love\, and the search for bel
 onging delivered with an ethereal\, angelic voice. Everly has worked with 
 a Grammy-winning producer and her full-length Destination and EP Honest Fl
 owers have both been critically acclaimed\, earning praise for her sinceri
 ty and warmth.
LOCATION:Brewsters Beer Garden
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107919094?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sister Act
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T153000
UID:250804WTibLc81Uk6k9nkTn9mvuQ
DESCRIPTION:**A Disco Diva\, a Choir in Crisis\, and a Whole Lot of Soul!*
 *\n\n***“One of the season’s happiest surprises.”* —Elisabeth Vinc
 entelli for New York Post**\n\n***Sister Act* is the high-energy musical c
 omedy based on the beloved 1992 film. Featuring an electrifying Alan Menke
 n score infused with disco and gospel beats\, this feel-good show is a cel
 ebration of music\, sisterhood\, and second chances.**\n\n**When disco div
 a Deloris Van Cartier witnesses a crime\, she’s forced into hiding—in 
 a convent! Disguised as a nun\, she transforms the struggling choir with h
 er powerhouse voice\, helping them find their sound while discovering her 
 own. Nominated for five Tony Awards\, *Sister Act* is a joyful\, soul-stir
 ring spectacle that proves music—and a little mischief—can work miracl
 es!**\n\nThursdays\, Fridays & Saturdays @ 7:30pm\, Saturdays and Sundays 
 at 2:00pm Run Time: Two hours\, 30 mins including intermission\n\nThursday
 s Adult $33Fri/Sat Eve Adult $44.95\; Senior $38.95\; Under 18 $31.95Sat/S
 un Matinee Adult $55.95\; Senior $48.95Value seating $37.95\\*All prices i
 nclude fees\n\n(707) 523-4185\n\n**boxoffice@6thstreetplayhouse.com**
LOCATION:6th Street Playhouse
URL:https://6thstreetplayhouse.com/shows/2025-26/sister-act/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
