BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Death Curious Workshop:  Prepare with Care - Live with Joy!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260608T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260608T163000
UID:260515pPtDPtO7T0St9tGPjurvYw
DESCRIPTION:Most of us mean to do it. Few of us do.\n\nThe people who will
  care for you — or care for your affairs — need more than good intenti
 ons. They need documents\, passwords\, account numbers\, and to know where
  things are. In a world where so much of life lives online\, an undocument
 ed digital life can stop everything cold.\n\nWhether you have a close circ
 le or are navigating life more independently\, getting organized is one of
  the most concrete acts of care you can offer. The earlier\, the kinder.\n
 \nJoin End of Life Doula Linda Suhr for a practical\, step-by-step worksho
 p covering the ten essential areas of end-of-life preparation — so the p
 eople you trust\, or the systems that will serve you\, can do their job.
LOCATION:Healdsburg Senior Center
URL:http://whenthetimecomes.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
